      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BROADWAY LANE (1) resumes as the horse to beat, with his last campaign bringing a close BM62 second at Streaky Bay and a solid fourth at this track when near the top of an open market. He is proven at this venue and at 1000m, and the 2kg claim gives him a sound platform fresh. LAPILLI (3) has the recent form query after two plain runs, but her profile is better than that. She has won at this track, has two wins around 1000m, and her overall ratings keep her right in the race if she returns in sharper order. KUBLAI (2) was safely held first-up but has a reliable track record and comes through the same recent meeting. Worth keeping in mind. TORNADO'S SISTER (4) has been freshened after a pair of flat performances and should find this easier. Can bounce back sharply.",
